Jeremy, I love your joke ideas, but this last idea I'd _love_ to see
implemented in some way. Why is it there are multiple ways to get
rocks and boulders, but _no way to make a wall_? Nothing fancy, you
understand, but it'd add so many new Fun Things To Do in the dungeon.
For that matter, I'd like to see other new ways to change terrain.
Pits, tunnels, and holes are great, but why not be able to spend a lot
of time and effort turning tunnels into a real room? (For that matter,
why do tunnel walls look so different from the walls in a room?)

Oh, the possibilities...

